ting, no mess, no charger needed.<\/p>"}},"text_xVfGQj":{"type":"text","settings":{"ques":"What makes your oral nicotine pouches different from other brands?","ans":"<p>We don’t mess around when it comes to quality. Our pouches are made to high standards with consistent nicotine delivery, smooth flavours, and premium materials. Every can is designed to deliver a satisfying experience—no weird aftertastes, no surprises.<\/p>"}},"text_ePGqpN":{"type":"text","settings":{"ques":"How should I store my nicotine pouches?","ans":"<p>Store your nicotine pouches in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Keep them in their original cans to maintain freshness and prevent the pouches from drying out. Properly stored oral nicotine pouches will maintain their flavour and effectiveness for months. Pro tip: keep them in the fridge for extra freshness!<\/p>"}},"text_fDta4K":{"type":"text","settings":{"ques":"How long should I keep nicotine pouches in for?","ans":"<p>We recommend you keep a nicotine pouch in for up to 30 minutes. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_JaTjtj","text_4aVx9q","text_GxgMkm","text_xVfGQj","text_ePGqpN","text_fDta4K"],"name":"FAQ section","settings":{"heading":"Common FAQ's"}},"16582928855dc3dfa2":{"type":"image_with_text_section","blocks":{"56502c04-5fd1-4644-9651-87995b052c27":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Over 18 years of age."}},"5e7573de-18ef-437a-863d-78ef2062b2e5":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Not pregnant, nursing or susceptible to cardiovascular disease."}},"62b46be2-857f-4818-adcb-a8cf176abc0e":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"Aware that nicotine is a highly addictive substance."}},"118cb823-0968-410c-aec2-f599e71a3a9a":{"type":"text","settings":{"list_item":"An existing smoker or vaper."}}},"block_order":["56502c04-5fd1-4644-9651-87995b052c27","5e7573de-18ef-437a-863d-78ef2062b2e5","62b46be2-857f-4818-adcb-a8cf176abc0e","118cb823-0968-410c-aec2-f599e71a3a9a"],"settings":{"title":"ONLY USE ÜBBS IF YOU ARE:","subtitle":"","